{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7390b758fd7251ae9c26ebcb5415998edfdf678d4602b347e567668c4dbe7cdf", "ja": "あなたを想って作りました", "zh": "想着你做出来的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a6fc7aab77168d3c0bb2d3d9ae6bf92c491c4953f4906f9a622155ba31f9da86", "ja": "『結婚相手に振る舞いたい手料理』という\nテーマの撮影で、プロデューサーを結婚相手\nに見立てて料理を作る響と奈緒。地元の味を\n知ってほしい！という気持ちや、健康への\n気遣いから、2人の結婚観が垣間見える。", "zh": "在以“想为结婚对象做的家常菜”为主题的拍摄中，响和奈绪把制作人当作结婚对象，为他做起了料理。想让他了解家乡的味道！以及对健康的关心，从中可以窥见2人的婚姻观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49502d7fa7ca6edfb28c3a21330399e596c776b0e5f784a35c354de973271fe3", "ja": "（ブライダル企画、本日は撮影日だ！\nといっても、ウェディングドレス姿等ではなく……）", "zh": "（婚礼企划，今天是拍摄日！不过，并不是要拍穿婚纱之类的内容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "0bda80483ff8a9454a4769ad9f6ca32843a3f329fb3ba9e7c683488c69a126fd", "ja": "自分の手料理の撮影……\nそんなの、カンペキに決めてみせるさー！", "zh": "拍摄我亲手做的料理……这种事，我一定能完美表现给你看——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "5b48dc6a37cfc2de5dc5a716fc916fedfdaa77d2a0306aef69f1918b2f206890", "ja": "仕事が忙しい時以外は、ちゃんとご飯を作って\nいぬ美たちと一緒に食べてるからね！", "zh": "除非工作特别忙，不然我都会好好做饭，和犬美它们一起吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "b9ce4551235aaeb0a1968873680290f45d0314a298564803a8108598d35a7af5", "ja": "私だって負けへんで～？　アニキと分担しながら、\n毎日のご飯のやりくりしてますから！", "zh": "我也不会输的哟～？我和哥哥分工合作，\n每天的饭食都安排得好好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7575cc2748974123eb2c495debfaaf35912d5a39128a64bace7b0a8768361f75", "ja": "ふたりとも地方出身の上京組だからな。\n料理に関しての心配はないだろうと思う！", "zh": "你们两个都是从地方来到东京打拼的，所以不用担心做饭方面的问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "651cfd7152f2e5f31c7db3f6521e458ec8db1b784681e7f7dec52c6e6c74584f", "ja": "ただ、今回はブライダル企画だからこその\n課題があって……。", "zh": "不过，这次是婚礼企划，所以有一个特别的课题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "10e4ab7c52a2b1968819cab1ff463596a5a528b3d3e6cc4856558d0f2eae645c", "ja": "「結婚相手に振る舞いたい手料理」でしょ？\nもちろんわかってるぞ！", "zh": "“想做给结婚对象吃的亲手料理”，对吧？\n响当然明白啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "e21ef63a1873bac8815cb44a0b1179bfc5dbe6c001af50286f796506d2ace96f", "ja": "結婚相手……つまり、今回は代理の\n{$P$}さんに向けて、ですよね？", "zh": "结婚对象……也就是说，这次是给代替结婚对象的{$P$}先生，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "03107d65b7c7c707affd756c0d7afdf831ba0a1015ffed97f3784f3f4e408726", "ja": "任しといてください！　{$P$}さんの\n胃袋、ぎゅーっと掴んでみせますから！", "zh": "包在我身上！我一定会牢牢抓住{$P$}先生的胃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "c9aed37ddaff867d3131feaf108289bdb0b95ea409e406fe37a301cef2995965", "ja": "自分だって！　ちゃちゃっと作っちゃうから、\n味見よろしくね！", "zh": "我也会！马上就做好，记得帮我尝尝味道哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f9408a9e3649ab1a1ce4ba7fe5cd59c8cada3fbb51f00d96c928bf10e57e68e8", "ja": "ああ！\nふたりとも、楽しみにしてるよ！", "zh": "啊！\n我也很期待你们两个的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "d780d23bf7b0b1c92bdd1bdcd7b35a01c41248bcdf9f1f41e0ef3c33298383ba", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　奈緒特製、\n1日分のカロリーが補給できるたこ焼きです！", "zh": "锵锵！这是奈绪特制的章鱼烧，能补充1天所需的热量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "4587c54bd3b22f34ca9a9fc2451d4461dd932269b2b29f36c8af2ab3c8248768", "ja": "お待たせ！　1日分の栄養が全部摂れる、\n完全栄養食サーターアンダギーだぞ！", "zh": "让你久等了！这是能补充1天所需全部营养的完全营养食品——萨塔安达吉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7d2c842878bb35dd06ff1c2ab063ab61396942c5818922740de7c33086fa4fff", "ja": "特殊な料理がきたな……。\n期待していたのとは、こう、方向性が……。", "zh": "这道菜还真特别啊……。和我期待的，怎么说呢，完全不是一个方向……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "128ee667eea7610b79a5f0460d8950901db1823fc5e90d9da9bebe3464495be0", "ja": "いやいや！　{$P$}さんのこと\n考えたら、こういう料理になるに決まってます！", "zh": "哪有哪有！考虑到{$P$}先生的事，\n肯定就会做成这样的菜啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "5fb20ff6b2cd5316698e6ee3c8fa580db3ce38d49c92ceaf9cdabef2100af8f6", "ja": "カロリーの詰め方、美奈子に聞いてきてん。\n忙しくても効率よくカロリー摂れるやろ？", "zh": "我是去向美奈子请教怎么把热量塞进去的。\n就算很忙，也能高效地摄取热量，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "cb12b7d222606ddf74e00e271768f57b846648916f15609e1a59c3ad4b997262", "ja": "そうそう！　自分から見ても、とにかく\n{$P$}は忙しそうだからね！", "zh": "对对！在我看来，{$P$}看起来特别忙呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "07bb467a315737357f5c2284aba51b7e2f0bd1b055c24e0493ae416218158f47", "ja": "体は、食べ物で作られてるんだから。\nちゃんと栄養と健康を気にしないと！", "zh": "身体可是由食物构成的。\n所以要好好注意营养和健康！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d25a9495942e8c3fb68b7cf1544edd5879670af5178cbe78c969eba6e8c1a03d", "ja": "そうか……。ふたりにそう思われてるなら、\n本気で生活を改めないとダメかもしれないな……。", "zh": "这样啊……既然你们两个都这么觉得，那我可能真的得认真改善一下生活了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "577feb82c4e17e6239cafef5b1abd503a7a73d98d8fec7afd8915b1d534aa841", "ja": "前置きはそんなとこです。\n遠慮せんと、食べてみてください！", "zh": "铺垫就到这里吧。\n别客气，尝尝看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "02854ff1e2a1bd51d4a37caed1c273b2857d431a906f8884ec8db020eb566641", "ja": "色がなかなか不安にさせてくれるけど……\nええい、いただきます！", "zh": "这颜色还真让人不安……不管了，我开动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "dcf83899ca8da7b3ead86ac33d244d448ebbf48f4d27dbd3ca259f3442b450cd", "ja": "……？？？　あれっ？\nふたつとも、すごく美味しい！？", "zh": "……？？？　咦？\n两个都特别好吃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "0dc146ec6c43dbbd3bf9a9057e0ca061d2327f3bec19350ce00ecb636f7b0f69", "ja": "当然さー！　味見してないものを、\n人に出すわけないでしょ？", "zh": "那当然啦！怎么可能会拿\n没尝过味道的东西给人吃嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "dacc3aed0aaf65b65a3a23054b01f0b7c7caf019c70f145a5889e945dd2d8a28", "ja": "たこ焼き器は私の嫁入り道具ですよ？\n滅多なもん作るわけないです。", "zh": "这台章鱼烧机可是我的嫁妆哦？才不会做出什么乱七八糟的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c9fb553c8b9e5477086634cedfeaf6d0a38a3d199f77138d2c45b9f693a1d8a7", "ja": "うーむ。特殊なアレンジだから不安だったけど、\nさすがの腕前だな、ふたりとも……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然是特别的改良做法，让我有点不放心，不过你们两个的手艺果然厉害啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "0651cb9f66007a523a185e88e5359d018a89836921a1152d70ffa474bc0b4daf", "ja": "ほんまは、無理にたこ焼きでなくても\nええかなって考えたんですけど……。", "zh": "其实我本来在想，不一定非得做章鱼烧也可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "3138cedf4ea4da3a82b956de56290d1c70e541709eaafd603582f8845b5c20b1", "ja": "やっぱ結婚する人には、私の地元の味を\n知っててほしいなー、なんて……えへへ。", "zh": "但还是希望未来的结婚对象，能了解\n我老家的味道呢～什么的……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "338e5e3e45f8e5807a2209101f2debf75bc1aedddaba3c7875ab97e0f8b3bf7e", "ja": "それ、わかるぞ！　結婚する人には、自分の\n地元の味を好きになってほしいって思う！", "zh": "这个我懂！我也希望结婚对象能喜欢上自己家乡的味道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee5f275e038f2f5ad6ef8d3abe65cab362958cf68dcd6e5fbe710d64bbad871c", "ja": "それでね、沖縄の味をもうひとつの地元の味だって\n思ってほしいくらいさー！", "zh": "所以啊，我甚至希望你能把冲绳的味道也当成另一种家乡的味道啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "d668df62be195080daf3c30b51cdafcc8fd744f19e612857cf8dfd2ccaa07885", "ja": "せやな！　地元の味を受け入れてもらうんは、\nそのまんま私を受け入れてもらうみたいなもんで……。", "zh": "是啊！让大家接受家乡的味道，就像是接受原原本本的我一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "ef01adaff0c4b9265faf0ee43f7c503665acc61998071301b4488f4b2c94ba35", "ja": "なんや、たこ焼きひとつで大げさかも\nしれへんけど……でも、本気の気持ちです！", "zh": "说起来，也许会觉得我因为一个章鱼烧就小题大做了……但这可是我的真心话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6f4e9192a7a0c9cfb0f68f88f07b1137def00fe040418ff09c67753d10e09911", "ja": "そうか……。ふたりにとって、\n地元の味はやっぱり特別なものなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……对你们两个人来说，家乡的味道果然很特别呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "15c2fe85b3b76829352e0544d0bb8822c3e964023048b246076677018f78a8fe", "ja": "改めて、たこ焼きもサーターアンダギーも\n文句なしに美味しかった！", "zh": "话说回来，章鱼烧和开口笑\n都无可挑剔地美味！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5391019e0d0caa5717476e8f58405f8be8c040f91d8c68e45f2f2a53d8c4e6bd", "ja": "それに、俺の体のことを考えたアレンジまで……\n毎日あれを食べられたら、忙しくても乗り切れそうだ。", "zh": "而且还特意考虑到我的身体状况，做了这样的调整……  \n要是每天都能吃到那个，就算再忙，我也觉得能撑过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "038db8fa2a2cd86dca01de6e8787b28107ac691a618319129a15c6c71f1a9b34", "ja": "毎日……？　ま、毎日ってなったら、\nそれは代理っていうか、ほ、ホンマのやつやん！", "zh": "每天……？要、要是每天都这样，那就不是代替，而是真正的那个了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "376f25b3c592bf566c1b9efad51588afa570461cf5963c68caf24b58ce7c4e6b", "ja": "か、勘違いしないでよ{$P$}！\nあくまで今回は代理なんだから！", "zh": "别、别误会啊，{$P$}！\n这次就只是暂代而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "af4424c297048eca4d954c62c1894b1cd9faf6a39427fd86603af91095154a48", "ja": "わ、わかってるわかってる！\nそういう意味で言ったわけでは……！", "zh": "我、我知道我知道！\n我不是那个意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "52237922381eccccd65071168fe2b5d65445da08ceb0374b3de9bbc6573a927d", "ja": "（ふたりの立場だからこその結婚観、\n今回で垣間見えたかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（或许这次能稍微窥见一些只有站在两人的立场上，才会有的婚姻观吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0288_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3cedb948098283fb562905c0272eda7080d18cad79b580e8c975cbe0bca12b50", "ja": "（アンケートの残りと撮影の数々も、この調子で\nそれぞれの色らしく進んでいくといいな！）", "zh": "（希望剩下的问卷和接下来的各种拍摄，也能照着各自的风格顺利进行下去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
